docs {
  # Reject Friend Request (`RejectFriendship`)
  
  **Handler**: `handlers.RejectFriendship` in [friendship_handler.go](file:///d:/Codes/budget-tracker/go-server/handlers/friendship_handler.go)
  **Route**: `POST /api/_private/v1/friendships/reject/:friendId` (Private - Bearer Token required)
  
  ### Description
  Rejects or cancels a pending friendship invitation:
  - Deletes the `Friendship` record matching the pending status.
  - Broadcasts `FRIEND_REQUEST_REJECTED` WebSocket event to the sender.
  
  ### Path Parameters
  - `friendId` (string, path parameter): User ID of the sender.
}
